{
  "label": "sanadorm25",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label sanadorm25:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, are you up to anything right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei? Just...a minute, please!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can hear Sana yell from behind her door.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, it’s not exactly a yell. This is still Sana we're talking about.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s more like the noise a mouse makes when you turn on the lights in the middle of the night and cause it to go scurrying off to the other side of the room.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just...somehow even less intimidating.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlinblackredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlinblackredux1.webp",
      "alt": "girlinblackredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...G...Good evening...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. What's going on? You didn't have to come out of your room.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlinblackredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlinblackredux2.webp",
      "alt": "girlinblackredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I was actually...on my way out already...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I interrupting something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I just...thought I’d go for a walk tonight.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I graciously accept your invitation for me to come along.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlinblackredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlinblackredux3.webp",
      "alt": "girlinblackredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...guess there's no stopping you now...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just so you know, though...I don’t really have anywhere in mind...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So we might just...walk around in circles...or something...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. You really know how to have a good time, don’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do my best...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlinblackredux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlinblackredux4.webp",
      "alt": "girlinblackredux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I could always...leave you behind...you know?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Being seen with someone like you might...cramp my style...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who taught you to speak like this? Because it sure as Hell wasn’t me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene girlinblackredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/girlinblackredux1.webp",
      "alt": "girlinblackredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think Rin might be rubbing off on me...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s also been...helping me get better at talking to people in her spare time...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well...that definitely makes a little more sense than Sana just suddenly thinking she’s better than me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin is essentially Kumon-mi's resident expert at playful banter, so Sana’s in good hands.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I just hope she doesn’t become a little...too much like Rin because I'm not quite sure how I'd handle her calling me homie.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...are you ready to go or...did you want to stop somewhere first?..",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where would I even stop? Does the dorm suddenly have a gift shop that no one's told me about or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I...I don’t know...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm just...trying to be polite...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The two of us set off down the road and pass by several shops closing down for the night.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana doesn’t seem eager to stop at any of them...She literally just wants to walk. That's it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which is fine, I guess. I mean, I’m no stranger to going out without a gameplan in mind...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But the fact that Sana wants to do something like this with me is an occurrence I didn’t think would be happening for quite a while.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe that talk we had on the beach helped her get a little more comfortable with me after all?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench1.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay...we’ll stop here for now.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Finished with your weird, aimless walking plan?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s...only weird if you make it weird...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s wrong with two friends going out for a walk in the middle of the night?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench2.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I told you during vacation that I start getting a little...happier once the weather changes.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And tonight is the coldest it’s been in a while...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench1.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t you think so, Sensei?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean...Sure, I guess. I haven’t really been paying much attention to the weather.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not dying from heat exhaustion, though. So that’s definitely a good sign.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench3.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...it’s kind of miraculous we’ve made it this far...isn’t it?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Through Summer, I mean.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Every time it rolls around, I think to myself...Sana...you’re going to go out and...do things...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But then I take one look at the forecast and change my mind for the next six months...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does this mean you’re going to actually do things this winter?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Though...I’m not really sure what there is to do with my grand total of two friends...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How about karaoke?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench4.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve heard some rather...unpleasant stories about how Ayane acts during karaoke.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m suddenly stricken with a traumatic flashback involving Ayane and some song she sung in Spanish.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe it’s best if Sana doesn’t go down that path after all?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench1.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...wouldn’t be surprised if Rin was a good singer, though...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t really speak to how good I would be since I’ve never really...done something like that before, but...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How about you, Sensei? Are you a good singer?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this you inviting me to Karaoke?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench5.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As long as you can keep it a secret from Ayane.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench6.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah! That came out wrong!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t mean it like that!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just meant...so we wouldn’t have to hear Despacito!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Calm down, I know what you meant.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench7.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really need to be more careful...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like the more I learn to actually speak with you...the worse I get at saying the right thing...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that supposed to happen?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess so. That sort of thing just comes with the territory.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ready for another lesson, Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench8.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean...right now?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You normally only teach me speaking stuff at the bar...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now is as good a time as any. Please take note of this extremely vital information.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench9.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Give it to me.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench6.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait! That came out wrong too!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just teach me whatever it was you wanted to teach me!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right...well-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench9.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The more you talk, the more mistakes you’ll make.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’d think that learning how to speak publicly would put an end to things like that, but it's actually the opposite.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One of the biggest downsides to becoming a good speaker is that your mistakes become more visible than ever.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Once people start associating you with your linguistic skills, those same people will pounce on any slip-up just so they can feel better about themselves.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, if you think your problems are just going to go away once you get the basics down, you’ve got another thing coming.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench8.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was a lot more detailed than a normal lesson...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You didn’t even ask me to roleplay.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To be fair, your roleplaying during that game you guys played over vacation left me a little intimidated.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is strange because it was also one of the cutest things I’ve ever seen you do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench3.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...was hoping you’d never bring that up...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I got so wrapped up in the game that I...didn’t even realize you were there...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabench1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabench1.webp",
      "alt": "sanabench1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But thank you. For actually teaching me something today.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even if your lesson was just...another cynical outlook on how people take advantage of others.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, at the end of the day, lessons like that are the ones that really matter.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You never know when someone is going to just show up and ruin everything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, yeah...You’re a cynic...I get it.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t like what Rin is doing to you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
